    "body": "It does seem that Logger() doesn't need to return anything. The note below Logger() mentioning that the return value matters for consoles that tend to print return values of functions doesn't really apply here, since the return value of Logger() is never used anywhere, and that's more of a function of what the Web IDL says the return value is and how browsers treat that, vs what Logger() specifically returns.\r\n\r\nI don't understand your second point about Formatter(x).",
